"type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View.onScrollTargetVisibilityChange(idType:threshold:_:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onScrollTargetVisibilityChange(idType:threshold:_:)":{"title":"onScrollTargetVisibilityChange(idType:threshold:_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/onScrollTargetVisibilityChange(idType:threshold:_:)","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onScrollTargetVisibilityChange","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"ID","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"idType","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"threshold","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeId